        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"2405f015-4b5b-44bb-b1c8-d786c7a4e340\",\"review_text\":\"Lack of add while listening music and irritating to purchase primium going to uninstall ur app\"},{\"review_id\":\"150f3623-250b-4753-8e24-f6d2ef9d2f10\",\"review_text\":\"I can't open the app it only displays the logo. I tried clearing the data and cache but still doesn't work.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b38d7820-62d0-4826-b09a-e12fabe6287d\",\"review_text\":\"Instead of being able to skip songs 6 times, the user has to be able to CHOOSE the song they want to listen for a limited time for the day. Ex, 3 times or so.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ca7e0719-831e-42e9-80dd-83cfbc477209\",\"review_text\":\"Its great no cap\"},{\"review_id\":\"5a9241c2-aa2c-4902-a442-e3ae86bbe647\",\"review_text\":\"I like it it was great but how u have to pay for Premarin I hated premium like you have to pay $10 every month but it's a good app very nice but I hate premium like yeah you take away the premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"8ba06881-931a-403e-a4e2-9ae166e621dc\",\"review_text\":\"Perfect. Best music app ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"9a9b23f1-d67f-4696-b3a8-dff34d18d232\",\"review_text\":\"🤗🤗🤗😁\"},{\"review_id\":\"39fb9778-6ac5-425e-aeca-f496e71ac7b9\",\"review_text\":\"There is way to much ads. There is a minimum of 2 ads after each song. Would not recommend if you are not going to buy the premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"a0feb4d8-59d5-4ef0-8102-86b454007a5c\",\"review_text\":\"Every worrst handling this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"c404a0e7-6b6b-43fd-89cf-348c938913b5\",\"review_text\":\"It shows too much ads but the sound of this is like heaven and it's very premium quality sounds Spotify if you are reading this I suggest you to more and more songs keep going\"}]}"
